{#
    A step of a long form: a card whose header holds an icon on a tinted avatar, the title, a description and a badge.
    "tone" and "badgeTone" are Tabler colours: primary, teal, blue, purple, pink, green, yellow, secondary.

    <twig:FormCard icon="lucide:map-pin" tone="yellow" title="3. Lieu" description="…" badge="Sur la carte">…</twig:FormCard>

    Composed, e.g. to put a button in the header:
    <twig:FormCard>
        <twig:block name="header">
            <twig:FormCard:Header icon="lucide:map-pin" title="3. Lieu">
                <twig:block name="aside"><button class="btn btn-sm">…</button></twig:block>
            </twig:FormCard:Header>
        </twig:block>
        …
    </twig:FormCard>
#}
{% props icon = null, tone = 'primary', title = null, description = null, badge = null, badgeTone = 'secondary' %}
<section {{ attributes.defaults({class: 'card form-card'}) }}>
    <div class="card-body">
        {% block header %}
            <twig:FormCard:Header icon="{{ icon }}" tone="{{ tone }}" title="{{ title }}" description="{{ description }}" badge="{{ badge }}" badgeTone="{{ badgeTone }}" />
        {% endblock %}
        {% block content %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
</section>
